#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:5
msgid "Beware of Phone Scams – HSBC HK"
msgstr "電騙陷阱 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:11
msgid "Stay Safe from Phone Scams"
msgstr "提防電話騙案"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:18
msgid ""
"Picture this: while watching TV at home one night, your mobile phone "
"rings. A number starting with '+852' shows up on screen."
msgstr "某晚在家看電視的時候，您的電話突然響起。您拿起手機一看，是一個「+852」字頭的號碼來電。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:19
msgid ""
"You pick up. The caller addresses you by your surname and claims to work "
"for the government."
msgstr "電話裏的人自稱政府機構職員，說得出您的姓氏，還說："

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:20
msgid ""
"We suspect you're involved in illegal money laundering activities. We "
"need your personal details, bank account information and passwords for "
"our investigation."
msgstr "我哋懷疑您洗黑錢。您必須立即提供個人資料、銀行戶口同密碼，協助我哋調查。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:21
msgid ""
"You'll probably start to panic. The caller seems to make so much sense. "
"After all, they're calling on behalf of the government, which you "
"respect."
msgstr "您驚慌失措，越聽越覺得對方有道理，政府人員總不會不可信吧？"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:22
msgid ""
"To prove your innocence, would you give them your account details and "
"passwords? Or will you take a minute to gather your thoughts, calm down "
"and contact the institution or your bank to confirm the caller's real "
"identity? The bank would be able to verify whether your accounts or "
"finances have been compromised."
msgstr "為了證明自己的清白，您會將戶口資料和密碼全部交出，還是先冷靜下來，向機構或銀行核實來電者身分，再向銀行確認您的戶口和資金有沒有被動用？"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:23
msgid "No way, I'd never fall for such a scam!"
msgstr "我唔會上當嘅！"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:24
msgid ""
"That's a common thought among many, but is it safe for you to make such "
"an assumption? You may think you won't give out private information. But "
"what if they ask for your full name and date of birth to help with their "
"investigation?"
msgstr "很多人都有這樣的想法，但這樣想會不會忽視了假冒來電的危險？您可能認為自己才不會這麼容易就將個人資料雙手奉上。但您以為只是「協助調查」，提供全名和出生日期就無問題？"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:25
msgid ""
"Experienced scammers know how to get what they want, even if you say no "
"at the start. The caller will probably ask more questions to push you to "
"disclose more personal details so they can 'confirm your identity'. By "
"the time you realise you've shared too much, it's probably already too "
"late."
msgstr "騙徒是捉弄人心的高手，即使您一開始拒絕他們的要求，他們仍然會威逼利誘，要您透露更多敏感資料來「驗證身分」。到您發現自己說得太多時，可能已經太遲。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:26
msgid ""
"Besides, would you know if you'd ever accidentally shared your personal "
"data and identity online? Remember, every time you share or tell someone "
"your personal information online, digital footprints are created, making "
"you more vulnerable to social engineering attacks."
msgstr "況且，您對自己的資料和身分安全真的從來沒有疏忽大意嗎？只要公開、透露或提供過個人資料，就會留下數碼足跡，騙徒用「社交工程」的技倆就可以乘虛而入。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:27
msgid ""
"To find out more about these and how to protect yourself, read How to "
"avoid social engineering scams."
msgstr "想知道到底甚麼是「社交工程」？可以怎樣防範？參考如何防範「社交工程」詐騙，了解保護自己的方法。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:30
msgid "Tips to avoid phone scams"
msgstr "防範電騙貼士"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:31
msgid ""
"Take these important steps to prevent fraudsters from getting what they "
"want."
msgstr "要進一步保障自己，記得做好以下措施，令騙徒無計可施。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:33
msgid "Don't give away sensitive details to strangers:"
msgstr "切勿向陌生人提供敏感資料："

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:33
msgid ""
"These include your online banking credentials and one-time passwords "
"(OTPs)."
msgstr "例如銀行登入資料及一次性密碼（OTP）。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:34
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:38
msgid "Pay attention to the calling number on your phone screen:"
msgstr "留意來電號碼："

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:34
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:38
msgid ""
"Phone numbers starting with a '+' are from overseas. So if a number "
"starts with '+852', it's most likely a spoofed number and not a local "
"call."
msgstr "「+」圖示表示號碼屬境外來電，如果同時顯示香港區號「852」，則極有可能是偽冒號碼。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:35
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:39
msgid "Confirm the caller's identity:"
msgstr "核實來電者身份："

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:35
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:39
msgid ""
"Email, call or visit official websites to verify if the caller does work "
"for the institution, bank or company."
msgstr "電郵、致電或前往機構、銀行或公司的官方網站確認對方身分。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:36
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:40
msgid "Don't overshare your personal details on social media:"
msgstr "避免在社交媒體分享太多個人資料："

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:36
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:40
msgid ""
"Scammers can easily piece together a story from the information you share"
" online and scam you."
msgstr "日常生活在網上世界分享得越多，騙徒掌握得越多，更可以藉此編造故事來欺騙您。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:37
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:41
msgid "Activate two-factor authentication (2FA):"
msgstr "採用雙重認證"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:37
#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:41
msgid ""
"Use multi-factor or biometric authentication to make your devices more "
"secure."
msgstr "在裝備啓用雙重認證或生物認證功能，加強裝置的保安。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:43
msgid ""
"Scammers are usually well-versed in playing psychological games and "
"creating elaborate schemes to trick you. If you receive a suspicious "
"call, the best approach is to keep calm and just hang up."
msgstr "騙徒善於玩弄您的心理，捏造事實引您上當。如接到可疑來電，記得保持冷靜，立即掛線。"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:44
msgid "If you think you've been scammed, "
msgstr "如果懷疑已經遇上詐騙，請即時"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:44
msgid "report it to HSBC immediately"
msgstr "向我們舉報"

#: frontend/templates/phone-scams.html:44
msgid "."
msgstr "。"

